cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Surrey ArcGIS public-data proof"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: "ParalleX Labs Inc."
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Static public-data technical proof showing City of Surrey development application boundaries as schematic 3D
  extrusions with the ArcGIS Maps SDK for JavaScript, an illustrative podium-and-tower asset, versioned demonstration
  attribute corrections with exact rollback, and an accessible facts list. Not a City of Surrey system. The Apache-2.0
  licence covers only this project's own code; the ArcGIS Maps SDK for JavaScript is a separate proprietary Esri
  dependency under Esri's terms and is not vendored in this repository.
keywords:
  - ArcGIS Maps SDK for JavaScript
  - open data
  - 3D
  - accessibility
  - Surrey
